{
  "manifest_version": 3,
  "name": "AI Collab System - Prompt Pack",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "AI Chat Automation with 10 Platform Adapters, NotebookLM Integration, and Pack Workflow Engine",
  "permissions": ["storage", "activeTab", "scripting"],
  "_comment_host_permissions": [
    "★ 这些模式决定了扩展能碰哪些站点——写错一个字符，那个站点上就",
    "  **完全没有内容脚本**（扩展看起来装了、点了没反应）。",
    "  Chrome 的 host 匹配里 `qianwen.com` **只等于** `qianwen.com`，",
    "  不等于 `www.qianwen.com`（`*.` 才是通配）⇒ 带 www 的真实站点",
    "  必须单写一条。",
    "  2026-10-26 实测踩过：千问的真站是 www.qianwen.com、Kimi 是 www.kimi.com，",
    "  这里原先只写了不带 www 的 ⇒ 内容脚本**根本没注入** ⇒ 整条链路是死的。",
    "  守护：tests/external-user-path.test.mjs 的「manifest 必须盖住平台注册表声称支持的站点」。",
    "  host_permissions 与 content_scripts.matches 必须保持一致（同一份清单，不许各写一份）。"
  ],
  "host_permissions": [
    "https://claude.ai/*",
    "https://chat.openai.com/*",
    "https://chatgpt.com/*",
    "https://gemini.google.com/*",
    "https://kimi.moonshot.cn/*",
    "https://kimi.com/*",
    "https://www.kimi.com/*",
    "https://qianwen.aliyun.com/*",
    "https://tongyi.aliyun.com/*",
    "https://qianwen.com/*",
    "https://www.qianwen.com/*",
    "https://yiyan.baidu.com/*",
    "https://wenxin.baidu.com/*",
    "https://chatglm.cn/*",
    "https://yuanbao.tencent.com/*",
    "https://longcat.ai/*",
    "https://longcat.chat/*",
    "https://chat.deepseek.com/*"
  ],
  "background": {
    "service_worker": "src/background/service-worker.js",
    "type": "module"
  },
  "content_scripts": [
    {
      "matches": [
        "https://claude.ai/*",
        "https://chat.openai.com/*",
        "https://chatgpt.com/*",
        "https://gemini.google.com/*",
        "https://kimi.moonshot.cn/*",
        "https://kimi.com/*",
        "https://www.kimi.com/*",
        "https://qianwen.aliyun.com/*",
        "https://tongyi.aliyun.com/*",
        "https://qianwen.com/*",
        "https://www.qianwen.com/*",
        "https://yiyan.baidu.com/*",
        "https://wenxin.baidu.com/*",
        "https://chatglm.cn/*",
        "https://yuanbao.tencent.com/*",
        "https://longcat.ai/*",
        "https://longcat.chat/*",
        "https://chat.deepseek.com/*"
      ],
      "js": ["src/content/content-script.js"],
      "run_at": "document_idle"
    }
  ],
  "action": {
    "default_popup": "public/popup.html",
    "default_icon": {
      "16": "public/icons/icon16.png",
      "48": "public/icons/icon48.png",
      "128": "public/icons/icon128.png"
    }
  }
}
